 middle value of the county&rsquo;s 4 grids. In 2025 that middle ran 204% of normal in April to May and 66% in July to August. So far in 2026 it sat at 56% of normal in February to March. All 4 grids had their driest year in 1999, and grid 21483 was lowest at 67% that year.</p>"}
